     4455     else do:
     4456       find first in-vatp_doc-attroprl no-lock
     4457         where in-vatp_doc-attroprl.doc-code  = out-vatp_partsprl.out-code
     4458           and in-vatp_doc-attroprl.attr-code = 'envd':U
     4459         no-error .
     4460       if not available in-vatp_doc-attroprl then do:
